{"title":"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> be a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Parallelogram\" title=\"Parallelogram\">parallelogram</a>.  Extend <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/6/b6691251a362837413262d094d29f92be951d579.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{DA}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> to a point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/e/ede78a06018011f48c24a76284afce482ebc6c47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /> and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/9/a894a620b157358dab619a863fdea6c368d3d0cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{PC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> meet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e2b592390eb6ec918fa6f3292716ce170de66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/7/907e515c43197f174b604b7332f14b3f231d7ce1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{DB}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/0/0001b2ee54d88d0d1930503b5e5e962199c16e04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" />  Given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/d/3ed29a9634d7ff9a0b8e4dd1864e80f6c09f18f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQ = 735$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/e/0feea787831274c0e23a4a2fb24cf9632d48edb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$QR = 112,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"83\" height=\"16\" /> find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/d/67d841c1b261b0657c3aa40c3689fa86bc234b6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$RC.$\" width=\"30\" height=\"12\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AIME_1998-6.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/2/2e/AIME_1998-6.png/350px-AIME_1998-6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"350\" height=\"327\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/2/2e/AIME_1998-6.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</p><p>There are several <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Similar_triangles\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Similar triangles\">similar triangles</a>. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/6/54618a33ec96bac69097380934cd095295660c0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle PAQ\\sim \\triangle PDC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"142\" height=\"17\" />, so we can write the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Proportion\" title=\"Proportion\">proportion</a>:\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/5/7b5307f083f91bd841f57fd4bcae9f5a5a9a3c5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AQ}{CD} = \\frac{PQ}{PC} = \\frac{735}{112 + 735 + RC} = \\frac{735}{847 + RC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"350\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n</div> \n<p>Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/c/56c39d141a975f3a73332a491375ea9e8f48866e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BRQ\\sim DRC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"127\" height=\"17\" />, so:\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/9/1692fdf1302016b2272d38e660ca28511250021b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{QR}{RC} = \\frac{QB}{CD} = \\frac{112}{RC} = \\frac{CD - AQ}{CD} = 1 - \\frac{AQ}{CD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"342\" height=\"38\" /><br />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/c/d5c696fcfbd631b04d436daa8dfe9ce5892c3bf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AQ}{CD} = 1 - \\frac{112}{RC} = \\frac{RC - 112}{RC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"226\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n</div> \n<p>Substituting,\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/9/f893b31eb6c1631f5033569ebd2d68cea8467065.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AQ}{CD} = \\frac{735}{847 + RC} = \\frac{RC - 112}{RC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"244\" height=\"39\" /><br />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/0/8d049190287361a770374b6c9a12a7a0fdfc55cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$735RC = (RC + 847)(RC - 112)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"261\" height=\"18\" /><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/0/af0984e21f6760bbfe3da43075549154744849af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 = RC^2 - 112\\cdot847$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"161\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n</div>\n<p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/c/d9c5d2f70a960cadf0f16fb0280e9a6c775bdbcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$RC = \\sqrt{112*847} = 308$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"190\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/2/492c4435ce03ffa4272d30a9c743280971759558.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BRQ\\sim \\triangle DRC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"143\" height=\"17\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/e/89e38f4ae8347871ac68ac41db9842ed46ea1464.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{112}{RC} = \\frac{BR}{DR}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"88\" height=\"37\" />. We also have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/9/46988193f7d90559c74e107f113e3811996ede3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BRC \\sim \\triangle DRP$\" width=\"143\" height=\"13\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/8/4d8c1b9ee5844aa36597e39833d3e65ec9f98f58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{ RC}{847} = \\frac {BR}{DR}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"88\" height=\"38\" />. Equating the two results gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/2/1a23d6ba17f1d583a87d55f6142c69077ce8726a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{112}{RC} =  \\frac{ RC}{847}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"87\" height=\"38\" /> and so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/4/ea4f7ac8f369ce2d6e1d8c27c8cc245c905d695c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$RC^2=112*847$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"131\" height=\"15\" /> which solves to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/c/14c8aee7857c1065869004ea620852fa97277b93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$RC=\\boxed{308}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"91\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME\" title=\"1998 AIME\">1998 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1998\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017191202\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.066 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 229/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1766/2097152 bytes\nTemplate arg